      "text": [
        "ه عن جابر بن إسماعيل فقد رويته عن أبي- رحمه اللّه- عن سعد بن‌ عبد اللّه، عن سلمة بن الخطّاب، عن محمّد بن اللّيث، عن جابر بن إسماعيل‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Jabir ibn Ismail has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) have mercy on him - from Sad ibn Abdullah, from Salamah ibn Al-Khattab, from Muhammad ibn Al-Laith, from Jabir ibn Ismail."
        ]
      }
